<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>VX6 BOT</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.png" type="image/png">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;800&family=Inter:wght@400;600&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        .cmd-name {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .public-layout header nav {
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="public-layout">
    <header>
        <div class="logo">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i> VX6 BOT
        </div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#admin">核心管理</a>
            <a href="#moderation">工具指令</a>
            <a href="#entertainment">娛樂互動</a>
            <a href="#info">資訊回饋</a>
            <a href="/invite" class="auth-btn glow">邀請機器人 <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero-section" style="padding: 4rem 2rem;">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span class="badge">指令優先模式</span>
                <h1>VX6 BOT</h1>
                <p>我們移除了解決方案中的網頁儀表板，現在您可以直接在 Discord 中完成所有設定。快速、安全且無縫整合。</p>
                <div class="cta-group">
                    <a href="/invite" class="btn-primary">立即部署</a>
                    <a href="#admin" class="btn-secondary">查看完整指令</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Category: Core Admin -->
        <section id="admin" class="features-section">
            <h2 style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-sliders"></i> 🛠️ 核心管理</h2>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="feature-card" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--warning-color);">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/config</div>
                    <h3>核心配置中心</h3>
                    <p>管理公告、歡迎、經濟、AI、等級系統等全域設定。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/setup</div>
                    <h3>快速初始化</h3>
                    <p>設定工單紀錄 (Transcripts) 發送頻道。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/setup-ai</div>
                    <h3>AI 頻道配置</h3>
                    <p>將 AI 對話功能綁定至指定頻道。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/admin</div>
                    <h3>管理控制台</h3>
                    <p>一鍵進入踢出、封鎖、禁言等管理介面。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/reactionrole</div>
                    <h3>身分組領取</h3>
                    <p>創建點擊按鈕即可領取身分組的精美訊息。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Category: Moderation & Tools -->
        <section id="moderation" class="features-section" style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.015);">
            <h2 style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> 🛡️ 管理與工具</h2>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/clear</div>
                    <h3>訊息清理</h3>
                    <p>批量刪除頻道中的歷史訊息 (1-100 則)。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/ticket</div>
                    <h3>進階工單系統</h3>
                    <p>包含建立(setup)、領取(claim)、關閉(close)及成員管理功能。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/say</div>
                    <h3>機器人發話</h3>
                    <p>讓機器人以系統身份在指定頻道發送訊息。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/voice</div>
                    <h3>動態語音</h3>
                    <p>管理語音頻道鎖定、隱藏、更名、踢出成員等。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/panel</div>
                    <h3>快捷面板</h3>
                    <p>開啟包含抽獎、音樂、日誌的快速操作中心。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Category: Entertainment -->
        <section id="entertainment" class="features-section">
            <h2 style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad"></i> 🎮 娛樂與互動</h2>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/music</div>
                    <h3>音樂播放</h3>
                    <p>包含播放、停止、跳過、佇列、音量調整功能。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/economy</div>
                    <h3>經濟系統</h3>
                    <p>提供餘額查詢、每日簽到、富豪榜排名。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/giveaway</div>
                    <h3>抽獎管理</h3>
                    <p>輕鬆發起、結束或重新抽選活動獲獎者。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/poll</div>
                    <h3>簡易投票</h3>
                    <p>快速建立是非或多選投票，收集社群意見。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/earthquake</div>
                    <h3>地震速報</h3>
                    <p>配置中央氣象署地震即時通知訂閱系統。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/dice</div>
                    <h3>擲骰子</h3>
                    <p>簡單的互動小工具，決定今日運氣。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Category: Info -->
        <section id="info" class="features-section" style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.015);">
            <h2 style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> ℹ️ 資訊與回饋</h2>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/help</div>
                    <h3>幫助清單</h3>
                    <p>在 Discord 中查看所有指令的詳細分類說明。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/ping</div>
                    <h3>延遲測試</h3>
                    <p>檢查機器人與 Discord API 的即時連線延遲。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/serverinfo</div>
                    <h3>伺服器資訊</h3>
                    <p>顯示伺服器擁有者、建立時間、統計數據等。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/userinfo</div>
                    <h3>使用者資訊</h3>
                    <p>查詢成員加入時間、身分組、ID 等詳細內容。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/avatar</div>
                    <h3>取得頭貼</h3>
                    <p>獲取指定使用者的高解析度頭像連結。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="cmd-name">/donate</div>
                    <h3>支持開發</h3>
                    <p>獲取支持專案持續運行的贊助管道連結。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container footer-content"
            style="text-align: center; padding: 2rem 0; color: var(--text-secondary);">
            <p>&copy; 2024 VX6 指令系統。快速。安全。強大。</p>
            <div class="footer-links" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
                <a href="/terms" style="color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px;">服務條款</a>
                <a href="/privacy"
                    style="color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px;">隱私權政策</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/huchialun9-ctrl/-dc-.git" target="_blank"
                    style="color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px;"><i
                        class="fa-brands fa-github"></i> GitHub</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>